{"seq":23,"trial_id":"harness-zero-h2h-2026-11/claude-code-opus-gbrain-mu-v03-dev2/si-04-quarrendon-main-contact/r2","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T08:15:31.583Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"1135ae254dfd22f88220cd59031525fe4bcaf070dba43e49ab0db855d6dc92f7","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#north-team","text":"Ilse, the main contact is Thea Ramaswell, Director of Yard Operations at Quarrendon Freight Lines. She raised the door 6 duplicate arrivals on the morning shift (Dana mentioned it here on Aug 20, 2025). The case was the same trailer showing up as two 06:30 check-ins: the driver checked in at the kiosk and dispatch then added him by hand. Dana Okafor is the account manager on our side.","thread_ts":"1791987000.000129"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C16V9M1OB60","ts":"1791987000.000130","thread_ts":"1791987000.000129"}}
{"seq":24,"trial_id":"harness-zero-h2h-2026-11/claude-code-opus-gbrain-mu-v03-dev2/si-04-quarrendon-main-contact/r2","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T08:15:35.362Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"362f2f9ef3a649c202468680d00b430354f992cdaf4bbb657f74f7c21054bb92","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C16V9M1OB60","text":"I replied to Ilse in the thread on her message in #north-team. The main contact is **Thea Ramaswell**, Director of Yard Operations at Quarrendon Freight Lines.\n\n- **Where it came from:** Dana Okafor said in #north-team on Aug 20, 2025 that Thea had flagged the door 6 duplicate arrivals on the morning shift. The duplicates were one trailer logged as two 06:30 check-ins, once at the kiosk and once added by hand by dispatch. The public North team cheat sheet also lists Thea as the account's main contact.\n- **Also in the reply:** Dana Okafor is the account manager on our side.\n- **Only what Ilse can see:** Both sources are open to her: she's in #north-team, and the cheat sheet is a public file. A contact name counts as an operational fact, so no approval was needed."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C16V9M1OB60","ts":"1791987000.000131"}}
